    "B_shared_line_repairs": "In discovery-17-channel-h1, expanded-045-h1 and expanded-068-h1, B rewrites the heading before the sign: bottom to the and descent to rough. On that changed prefix the original already prefers plus in two of the three, and prefers minus by 0.15 in the third. The later lost-to-gained rung makes each continuation stay right. This is not a sign-only intervention on B's own path; the large sign-margin gains are conditional on the recordings' text.",
